  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.LoomOASIS v2.0.2\n\nConnects the OASIS to Loom — the async video messaging platform. Maps Loom workspace users to OASIS Avatars and Loom videos to OASIS Holons. Supports video upload via the Loom two-step create-then-upload flow, paginated listing, search, and folder-based hierarchy. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.1\n- feat: add LoomOASIS provider — Loom video messaging platform (6f0a56e)\n- feat: complete all 13 unpublished NuGet providers to publish-ready standard — READMEs, release notes, logo, metadata, copyright (0263a2b)\n- fix: put every project in a solution and fix the bugs that exposed (4612aa0)\n- Integrate provider capabilities and reuse deployed service configuration (8ac7f1f)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Social/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.LoomOASIS",
